   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TPP WILPF Colombia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">WILPF Colombia are partners to WILPF Sweden (IKFF) and one of the organisations implementing the Transformative Partnership Program (TPP). The grant aims to contribute to the development of LIMPAL Colombia&#x2019;s strategic work and implementation of their national program, to strengthen the organization&#x2019;s political positioning in advocacy spaces, expand women&#x2019;s civic space and to strengthen the political, organizational, and leadership capacities of women and youth, promoting their effective participation in advocacy spaces at the national and provincial levels.</narrative>
  </description>
